    "title": "Flamingo Bingo brings prizes and playful fun to 2026 Women's Expo on Mar. 14 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "17 hours ago BEDFORD — A tropical twist on a classic game is set to add excitement to this year’s Women’s Expo in Bedford. Flamingo Bingo will return as a featured attraction during the 2026 Women’s Expo, hosted by Southern Indiana’s Classic Hits 105.5 WQRK, 102.5 Litefm, and 1340 WBIW. The specialty bingo event will take place from 11 a.m. to 1 p.m. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
